   "explanation": "In the RM zone the minimum lot frontage is the \"f\" number on the zone label; if none, 12.0 m for a detached house or houseplex, 15.0 m for a semi-detached house and 24.0 m for an apartment building off a major street or a non-residential building. Each lot of a split pair needs half. On a major street, a street-fronting townhouse needs 6.0 m per unit (less 1.0 m per unit without its own driveway), and other townhouses need 30.0 m.",
